":5,"g":[["إِنَّ","ACC","stem",""],["هُۥ","PRON","suffix","PRON:3MS"]]},{"i":"42:51:21","a":"عَلِىٌّ","t":"(is) Most High","p":"N","tr":"ʿaliyyun","f":["MS","INDEF","NOM"],"r":154,"l":769},{"i":"42:51:22","a":"حَكِيمٌۭ","t":"Most Wise","p":"ADJ","tr":"ḥakīmun","f":["MS","INDEF","NOM"],"r":43,"l":112},{"e":"٥١","v":"42:51"}]}],"verses":[{"k":"42:45","t":"And you will see them being exposed to it [i.e., the Fire], humbled from humiliation, looking from [behind] a covert glance. And those who had believed will say, \"Indeed, the [true] losers are the ones who lost themselves and their families on the Day of Resurrection. Unquestionably, the wrongdoers are in an enduring punishment.\"","j":25,"h":49,"s":42,"a":45,"sd":null},{"k":"42:46","t":"And there will not be for them any allies to aid them other than Allāh. And whoever Allāh sends astray - for him there is no way.","j":25,"h":49,"s":42,"a":46,"sd":null},{"k":"42:47","t":"Respond to your Lord before a Day comes from Allāh of which there is no repelling. No refuge will you have that Day, nor for you will there be any denial.","j":25,"h":49,"s":42,"a":47,"sd":null},{"k":"42:48","t":"But if they turn away - then We have not sent you, [O Muḥammad], over them as a guardian; upon you is only [the duty of] notification. And indeed, when We let man taste mercy from Us, he rejoices in it; but if evil afflicts him for what his hands have put forth, then indeed, man is ungrateful.","j":25,"h":49,"s":42,"a":48,"sd":null},{"k":"42:49","t":"To Allāh belongs the dominion of the heavens and the earth; He creates what He wills. He gives to whom He wills female [children], and He gives to whom He wills males.","j":25,"h":49,"s":42,"a":49,"sd":null},{"k":"42:50","t":"Or He makes them [both] males and females, and He renders whom He wills barren. Indeed, He is Knowing and Competent.","j":25,"h":49,"s":42,"a":50,"sd":null},{"k":"42:51","t":"And it is not for any human being that Allāh should speak to him except by revelation or from behind a partition or that He sends a messenger [i.e., angel] to reveal, by His permission, what He wills. Indeed, He is Most High and Wise.","j":25,"h":49,"s":42,"a":51,"sd":null}],"juz":25,"hizb":49,"surahs":[42],"sajdah":false}